WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.146
Welcome to the Federal Modernization
Workbook's developer workbook,

2
00:00:04.146 --> 00:00:05.912
Building Non-Person Identity.

3
00:00:05.912 --> 00:00:09.550
This is Chapter 12: the managed
service account standard.

4
00:00:09.550 --> 00:00:12.272
A standard nobody checks is a suggestion,

5
00:00:12.272 --> 00:00:17.636
so this chapter checks it every time
something changes: a request, an aggregation,

6
00:00:17.636 --> 00:00:23.000
a certification, a Defender for Identity
scan, a disabled account's ninetieth day.

7
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:27.967
We'll see what the products give the
code, the import formats, the five checks,

8
00:00:27.967 --> 00:00:31.492
what the code hands to Chapter
6 and what it never does,

9
00:00:31.492 --> 00:00:33.975
the evidence, two labs and the dangers.

10
00:00:33.975 --> 00:00:39.190
One note before we begin: the code is
illustrative, tested against fixtures.
